course: dictionary
lesson: 15202
title: Selector: one word, three meanings
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: A selector is something or someone that chooses. The words around it tell you which meaning fits. These are the context clues.
explain: «The team selectors picked Maya for the cricket match.» Here the selectors are people who choose players. Test it: swap in "people who choose" and the sentence still makes sense.
explain: «Turn the gear selector to third before the hill.» A gear selector is a knob or switch for choosing a setting. The word «gear» is the clue: this sentence is about a machine, such as a car or a bike.
explain: On a computer, a selector is a tool or rule that picks out items, such as parts of a web page. When a word has more than one meaning, read the clues and choose the meaning that fits.
fact: A selector is a person who chooses players for a team.
fact: A selector can also be a device, knob or switch for choosing a setting.
fact: In computing, a selector is a tool or rule that picks out items.
fact: «Team selectors» means the people who choose a team.
fact: «Gear selector» means the switch that chooses a gear.
exercise: «The team selectors met on Monday to pick the squad.» Who are the selectors? | Players who run very fast | People who sell tickets at the stadium | The grass on the pitch | *People who choose the players for a team
exercise: «Dad moved the gear selector into reverse.» What is a gear selector? | A large wheel on a bicycle | *A switch for choosing a gear | A map of the roads | A kind of seat belt
exercise: In coding at school, what does a selector do? | It paints the colour of a web page | It makes sounds on a computer | It sends emails to the class | *It picks out parts of a web page
test: «The channel selector on the TV is stuck on one station.» What is a channel selector? | A small screen for watching films | A box for storing old DVDs | A person who chooses the TV presenters | *A switch for choosing a channel
test: «The selectors dropped two players from the squad.» What does selectors mean here? | A kind of fishing net | *A person who chooses players for a team | A tool that picks out items on a web page | A knob for turning up the volume
exam: Which sentence uses selector in the computing sense? | The gear selector clicked into fourth | The selector on the web page picked out every heading | The team selector met the coach on Friday | *A tool picked out all the images on the web page
